    Razor comments nest, which is why three unmatched openings simply swallow everything to
    the end of the file rather than leaking. The failure mode to watch for is the opposite: an
    unmatched *closing* marker ends the comment early, and that is a build error (RZ1003), not
    a silent leak - so this cannot break quietly. AnonymousAccessTests also asserts the
    placeholder text stays off the rendered page.
